# Pulsegrid has no build step and no dependencies — there is deliberately very little
# to ignore. Generated icons ARE committed: they're produced by tools/make-icons.mjs,
# but the PWA manifest references them directly and the service worker caches them, so
# a fresh clone must be installable without running a generator first.

node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
